&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; margin-bottom: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -36px"&gt;（注）１．当期増加のうち主なものは次のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 72px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 423.99999999999999999999999999px"&gt;
